<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is deploying AI-powered surveillance to target smuggling syndicates while police in Chiang Rai seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck, and floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households. The fruit sector faces a deepening labour shortage that is prompting the government to plan hiring workers from Sri Lanka for the first time. Cross-border financial scams are prompting a major crackdown that saw 39 arrests and the seizure of THB500 million in assets. 35 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOcXlDbzE0cmZDZTRlbFdIZm43TFNjUFZHWnNJd25HU0lhQjJhMWdLWGZlVjRNdl9aNUhwdlZ5UUtCakJVcmZDLUhVd21tTFQtUlM5YW12N0VsUk41bzFIdVc5d19pNnE2Qm5zTVZoN09iVUtMcUVyTkFDUnhYd05ucExOMXZnaTQ3QWlVd0RfUFdwbmVh?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPb01sSTMzNzE4VDcwTHZyMHlPUTZBYmtnVm9DQ2JPZmFLU0pXYW52Qmg5WTBSell2MzhuZjVnbTJadWZBNkh4MDFWc2Z5cmVJVGlIeFZOd0hlSDJGdkVORDR1cnRHRXI5anc3U3dheUpGTGRnOEx4ZHl0V2xsZ2FDenFIbnk5YnRHOGdROFJtc3JYZTJVb0d1andhTzV1T2FvdmRNbnZfOHBFWlY2RGFEeGtDN1hpVGx2Tk00Ri1Ma0hsN00?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPOEQzb0ZvNmltU014U0RiUFYxYkQxWDAyakdLb2ZvbDM4M3JkOGo3enl1NGhkbWZvanVwNGxKZkhORGhTYmtqLWwyYlpMRy1pMzJqY3Q3NGU5VGc3Q202LXF2Ull3dmY5MDZKT2lVdk9HMGFUMFM5UTJDbmgyOWp2Zy1ZN1VPdExvc3RtOFF5dzJWNGplczhHeUtVb05EMUpz?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Vibes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNTjM2cU9oUVNVVlRHUDMxQmdUY0JONVVtNEVHN1JSX0p3blk1Ykl1ODE4bFJ4X29jUFhYbmltZ2hPd1VvU2hQZ2JONVo3MnZuN3RTMUxwYzhJcklkMlJyeHBhM3p3UjhaeTgwWDJsUkJxcTFaWEVqMWRKVFAtLWQ2eXlOUk1TRXZ6Szdu